{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>If you lend money.</b> If it should come about in Israel that what is stated — אֶפֶס כִּי לֹא יִהְיֶה בְּךָ אֶבְיוֹן (Deuteronomy 15:4) — does not hold true, but rather what is stated — כִּי לֹא יֶחְדַּל אֶבְיוֹן (Deuteronomy 15:11) — does hold true among them, then a situation will arise in which you lend."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:48.322791045Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}